_qa/
assets/tesla1894/_qc/

# raw patent downloads from patents.google.com (keep the derived .webp only)
assets/tesla1894/patents/*.png

# Measured runs are kept in git as evidence; the caches that generate them are not.
__pycache__/

# Generated intermediate trees and the checkout of the pre-change state the
# commit machinery verifies against: rebuildable, not evidence, not shipped.
tests/.staging/

# probe.py rewrites this 50 KB JSON every time it runs, and the item-7 message says
# plainly that probe's report is a pre-gate diagnostic deliberately NOT shipped. Kept
# out of git so `git status` keeps meaning "these are the owner's files and only the
# owner's", which is the claim the sticky-bar and nav checks lean on.
tests/overflow/overflow-report.json
# pi's own per-checkout settings. Untracked today and 103 bytes, so nothing is
# exposed - but this repo's root IS the webroot, so a single `git add -u` or
# `git commit -a` would upload it to a public affiliate domain and it would stay
# there in caches. Ignored so the accident is not available to make.
.pi/
